# fx_helpers.md

## Overview
FX helper utilities provide shorthand wrappers so gameplay code can trigger common particle-style visuals without referencing low-level engine hooks.

## Utilities
- `spawnExplosionFX(manager, x, y)` spawns a short-lived explosion burst around the provided coordinates.
- `spawnDamageFlash(manager, x, y)` triggers a brief hit flash used to highlight impacted actors.

Both helpers forward into the generic effect scheduler that applies pooling and timing rules shared across the presentation layer.
